.TH SANCHALA-GUARDIAN 1 "August 2026" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-guardian \- Security center and threat protection for Sanchala OS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-guardian
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sanchala-guardian
is the central security management tool for Sanchala OS. It provides
real-time threat detection, permission management, AppArmor integration,
and security policy enforcement.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS "Status and Overview"
.TP
.B status
Display overall security status and health score
.TP
.B dashboard
Open the graphical security dashboard
.TP
.B report
Generate a security assessment report
.SS "Threat Detection"
.TP
.B scan \fR[\fIPATH\fR]
Scan file or directory for threats (uses ClamAV)
.TP
.B monitor \fR[\fBstart\fR|\fBstop\fR|\fBstatus\fR]
Control real-time file monitoring
.TP
.B threats
List detected threats and recommended actions
.TP
.B quarantine \fIFILE\fR
Move suspicious file to quarantine
.SS "Permission Management"
.TP
.B permissions \fR[\fIAPP\fR]
List or manage application permissions
.TP
.B grant \fIAPP\fR \fIPERMISSION\fR
Grant permission to application
.TP
.B revoke \fIAPP\fR \fIPERMISSION\fR
Revoke permission from application
.TP
.B audit \fR[\fIAPP\fR]
Show permission usage audit log
.SS "AppArmor Management"
.TP
.B profiles
List AppArmor profiles and status
.TP
.B enforce \fIPROFILE\fR
Set profile to enforce mode
.TP
.B complain \fIPROFILE\fR
Set profile to complain mode
.SS "Firewall"
.TP
.B firewall \fR[\fBstatus\fR|\fBenable\fR|\fBdisable\fR]
Manage firewall state
.TP
.B block \fIAPP\fR
Block application network access
.TP
.B unblock \fIAPP\fR
Allow application network access
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output in JSON format
.TP
.B \-q, \-\-quiet
Suppress non-essential output
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version information
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Check security status:
.B sanchala-guardian status
.TP
Scan downloads folder:
.B sanchala-guardian scan ~/Downloads
.TP
List Firefox permissions:
.B sanchala-guardian permissions firefox
.TP
Grant camera access:
.B sanchala-guardian grant zoom camera
.TP
JSON output for scripting:
.B sanchala-guardian status --json
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/guardian/guardian.toml
Main configuration file
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/guardian/policies/
Security policy definitions
.TP
.I /var/lib/sanchala/guardian/
State and database files
.TP
.I /var/log/sanchala/guardian.log
Log file
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
General error
.TP
.B 2
Security threat detected
.TP
.B 3
Permission denied
.SH D-BUS INTERFACE
.B org.sanchala.Guardian
on the system bus provides programmatic access to all guardian functions.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sanchala-permissions (1),
.BR apparmor (7),
.BR aa-status (8),
.BR clamav (1),
.BR firewalld (1)
